{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58f339aa9dc5a833d64ab","chatId":"5d0ed0b99e0f4b26bba14bffb43a8963","sessionId":null,"userId":95949,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":779,"promptTokens":2199,"completionTokens":50,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:04:35"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00407013825952249,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58f339aa9dc5a833d64aa","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477875079,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:04:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58f339aa9dc5a833d64aa","chatId":"5d0ed0b99e0f4b26bba14bffb43a8963","sessionId":null,"userId":95949,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n柳絮，孟楠和白浩天是公司的总部员工，他们正在为即将开展的春季团队活动讨论着。白浩天是活动的负责人，他倡议举办一次爬山活动。不过，柳絮和孟楠更想去钓鱼。柳絮看着孟楠，朝着白浩天使了一个眼神。孟楠摇摇头，似乎没什么信息。柳絮打起精神，一副胸有成竹的样子。白浩天在和别的同事聊天，并未留意别的事情。\n\n[问题]\n你认为白浩天是怎么想的？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 白浩天觉得很开心，他认为柳絮和孟楠的笑容代表了对他的认同。\nB. 白浩天注意到了孟楠和柳絮的神情，感到困惑和有些不安。\nC. 白浩天感到生气，因为孟楠和柳絮明显不听从他的建议。\nD. 白浩天没在意他两的互动，他在专心组织大家参与爬山活动。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00407013825952249,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58f339aa9dc5a833d64ab","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477875077,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:04:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4686bef5144844428e361e9dd65ceed3"}